# orc-barbarian-seed1-opt0822: the character tools/fixtures/chars/orc-barbarian-seed1-opt0822.sav
# holds, written by hand from the canonical dump of that file (tools/char_dump.sh).
# Written for inc-10v7f phase 7a, spec B7: the dump of the build of this file is
# compared with the dump of the old .sav by tools/check_handwritten_fixture.sh.
#
# Read from the dump: the name (Identity), the base attributes (BaseAttr), the
# perks (the journal's "Starting Perks": Bonus Feat Light Sleeper, Wild Talent
# Brain Lock), the feats, the hit and mana rolls, the skill ranks, the starting
# kit and its quantities, and the creation record (formulaSeed, storeSeed,
# Personality). The old .sav's Options line holds OPT_BEGINKIT=1, so the
# options are the kit variant of the dated settings file.
